WEBVTT

00:02:59.847 --> 00:03:02.599
You would listen in the neighborhoods
on any given night,

00:03:02.599 --> 00:03:05.827
and to the untrained ear,
it sounded like fireworks,

00:03:05.827 --> 00:03:07.207
but it was gunfire.

00:03:07.207 --> 00:03:11.040
You'd hear it almost every night,
when you were cooking dinner,

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:15.062
telling your child a bedtime story,
or just watching TV.

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:20.994
And you can go to any emergency
room at any hospital,

00:03:20.994 --> 00:03:24.123
and you would see lying on gurneys

00:03:24.123 --> 00:03:28.087
young black and Latino men
shot and dying.

00:03:28.697 --> 00:03:30.532
And I was doing funerals,